# ========================================================
# The Daily Pulse — optional environment variables
# ========================================================
#
# By default the app streams real-time news from free RSS
# feeds (BBC News + The Guardian) through public CORS
# proxies — no API key required.
#
# To use NewsAPI.org instead (free tier, 100 requests/day),
# register at https://newsapi.org/register and paste your
# key below, then restart the dev server:
#   npm run dev
#
VITE_NEWSAPI_KEY=